वलित, अस्, आ, अम्, surrounded; moved, moving;
turned, constrained; wrinkled, having wrinkles, con-
tracted into wrinkles; [cf. 2. बलित.]

वाल्कल, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. वल्कल), made of bark;
(ई), f. spirituous liquor; (अम्), n. a bark dress worn
by ascetics.
